    new "Yo... quiero..."

    old "I mean...I want to..."
    new "Quiero decir... quiero..."

    old "It was the truth."
    new "Era la verdad."

    old "Gratitude and desire were mixed in equal measure. He had saved her, and she wished to be grateful in word and body."
    new "La gratitud y el deseo se mezclaban en igual medida. Él la había salvado, y ella deseaba mostrarle su gratitud tanto con palabras como con su cuerpo."

    old "And in this brief moment, even the clothes between them were too great a separation to endure."
    new "Y en ese breve instante, incluso la ropa que los separaba parecía una barrera demasiado grande para soportar."

    old "She pulled away his shirt, and what little resistance he offered proved more for show."
